# A guard over `provenance` is rejected: provenance entries are ids, and a guard
# MUST NOT range over id (the no-id wall). Provenance is permitted only for the
# quorum distinctness predicate, never for a general guard.
actor a
human dpo role dpo
gate decide risk high grant a
reserve cross_border by dpo when provenance contains src_x
cord a -> decide
cord decide -> master
